measured floor  : 0.6187 0.0510
                  x white       : 0.6956 0.9636
                  THE FLOOR THE GATE ACTUALLY USED, averaged over 5 warped
  frames. The line above it is the white-noise constant, which is
  exact only for an UNWARPED frame; resampling correlates neighbours
                  and moves the per-band split. Bands past this list kept the constant.
                  STREHL_GATE_FLOOR=white restores it everywhere.
averaged        : 0.0% 0.0% 0.0% 100.0%
                  per level, the fraction of coefficients where NO frame cleared the noise
                  floor and the merge therefore averaged instead of selecting. Near 0%
                  everywhere would mean the gate is not gating and this is a naive
